      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        240,
        60
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 6,
        "width": 600,
        "height": 220,
        "content": "## LEARNING - Badge Check (RFC-022)\n\n**Endpoint:** POST /webhook/learning-badge-check\n\n**Parameters:**\n- `learner_discord_id` (required): Discord user ID\n- `guild_id` (required): Discord guild ID\n\n**Returns:**\n- `badges_awarded`: List of newly awarded badges\n- `badges_awarded_count`: Number of badges awarded\n- `progress_summary`: Current learner progress\n\n**Badges Checked:**\nfirst_lesson, first_course, week_streak, month_streak, quiz_master, level_5, level_10"
      }
    }
